.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt GPART 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm gpart
.Nd show GPT partitions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm show
.Op Ar block:0
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility reads the geometry and GPT partition records from the
.Dq block:
scheme and prints the start sector, size, index and name for every partition.
Partitioning write support is a follow-up.
This version lists the real records and never invents a table.
A device that cannot be opened or a malformed reply is an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success.
Returns 1 on a device or protocol error.
Returns 2 on usage errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lsblk 1 ,
.Xr newfs 8
